Additional provider ports adapt their corresponding *Provider Kotlin sources
at the same pinned upstream commit: BambooUA, CikavaIdeya, DoramyWorld, Eneyida,
KinoTron, KinoVezha, Kinostrain, KlonTV, Serialno, SimpsonsUATv, UAFlix,
UASerialsPro, UFDub. Site-specific parsers and public player serialization are
translated to the native SkyStream bridge; shared helpers live in shared/.
The current DoramyWorld data-player format and source markup corrections were
verified against public pages. No website JavaScript is evaluated.

